      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('SSR oscillator (stablecoin dry powder)','SSR 振荡器（稳定币场外资金）') }}</span><span><b>{{ onchain.ssr_osc if onchain.ssr_osc is not none else '—' }}</b> <span class="faint">{{ t('(high = more dry powder)','（高 = 场外资金更多）') }}</span></span></div></div>
      <div class="mini"><div class="lab"><span>{{ t('Miner Position Index (MPI)','矿工持仓指数（MPI）') }}</span><span><b>{{ onchain.mpi if onchain.mpi is not none else '—' }}</b></span></div></div>
      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('Both shown as CONTEXT, not signals: on our free-data sample the SSR oscillator had no clean forward-return edge, and MPI came out INVERTED (miner distribution coincided with continued upside). Kept honest rather than dropped. CryptoQuant\'s true moat — wallet-labeled exchange Netflow / Whale Ratio — is not reproducible free.', '两者仅作背景，而非信号：在我们的免费数据样本上，SSR 振荡器无明确前瞻收益优势，MPI 则呈反向（矿工派发与持续上涨同时出现）。如实保留而非删除。CryptoQuant 真正的护城河 — 带钱包标注的交易所净流量/巨鲸比率 — 无法免费复刻。') }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

