      <div class="sub" style="margin-top:8px">{{ t('The ~4-year time axis the model lacked. Calibrated (n=3 cycles, a soft PRIOR): the accumulation phase (post-halving) averaged +48%/90d at 81% hit; the markdown phase (mid-cycle) just +5%/90d at 43% hit. It tilts the scenario odds, never triggers.', '模型此前缺失的约 4 年时间轴。已校准（3 个周期，软先验）：累积期（减半后）90 天平均 +48%、胜率 81%；下跌期（周期中段）仅 +5%、胜率 43%。它用于微调情景概率，从不作为触发。') }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>{{ t('CME positioning & correlation', 'CME 持仓与相关性') }}
